<title>USA: HRE Properties gets $4 mln settlement.</title>
<headline>HRE Properties gets $4 mln settlement.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>HRE Properties said on Thursday that it has received a settlement offer in excess of $4 million from its single tenant at its Tempe, Ariz., property to adjust unpaid back rent.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust said that, under the settlement, it would receive a lump sum payment of $3.25 million for unpaid amounts accumulated before 1996 and payment of additional percentage rent estimated to be $400,000 per annum beginning in 1996 and continuing through the remainder of the lease term.</p>
<p>The company said the settlement is subject to approval by its board.</p>
</text>
